@startuml sequence-diagnostic-placement-m23
title SEQ-03: Stage-Adaptive Diagnostic Placement Assessment Flow (UC-03 / BF-08)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-04 / SCR-L-05)" as Web
control "Assessment Service\n(Route Handler / BFF)" as AssessSvc
control "Adaptive Item Engine\n(2-Stage Adaptive Router)" as ItemEng
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB

== 1. Test Session Initialization & Delivery ==
Learner -> Web: Start Diagnostic Assessment
activate Web
Web -> AssessSvc: POST /api/assessment/diagnostic/start { language: "en" }
activate AssessSvc
AssessSvc -> ItemEng: Initialize 2-Stage Session\n(Routing Stage: item batch across 4 dimensions [PROPOSED ~10-12 items, PENDING VALIDATION])
activate ItemEng
ItemEng --> AssessSvc: Return Routing Stage item batch
deactivate ItemEng
AssessSvc --> Web: 200 OK { sessionId, items: RoutingBatch }
deactivate AssessSvc

== 2. Execution & Stage Transition ==
loop Routing & Targeted Stage Submissions (Total items: [PROPOSED ~25-30 items, PENDING VALIDATION])
    Learner -> Web: Submit answers for current stage items
    Web -> AssessSvc: POST /api/assessment/diagnostic/stage-submit { sessionId, answers }
    activate AssessSvc
    AssessSvc -> ItemEng: Evaluate intermediate response pattern
    activate ItemEng
    alt Routing Complete -> Transition to Targeted Stage
        ItemEng --> AssessSvc: Return Targeted Stage item batch (calibrated difficulty)
    else Assessment Complete
        ItemEng --> AssessSvc: All stages complete, ready for scoring
    end
    deactivate ItemEng
    AssessSvc --> Web: Return next stage items OR completion signal
    deactivate AssessSvc
end

== 3. Final Evaluation & Evidence Persistence ==
Learner -> Web: Submit Final Assessment
Web -> AssessSvc: POST /api/assessment/diagnostic/complete { sessionId }
activate AssessSvc

AssessSvc -> AssessSvc: Calculate rawScores & dimensional breakdowns:\nVocabulary, Grammar, Reading, Listening (0-30 total scale per Mapping A)

AssessSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO "AssessmentResult" (\n  id, userId = auth.uid(), assessmentType = 'DIAGNOSTIC',\n  deliveryMode = 'PLACEMENT', dimensions = JSONB, rawScores = JSONB,\n  stageData = JSONB, languageConfig = JSONB, completedAt = now()\n) [IMMUTABLE EVIDENCE CHAIN - No persisted score/passed column]
activate DB
DB --> AssessSvc: AssessmentResult persisted
deactivate DB

AssessSvc -> DB: UPSERT "SkillProfile" (\n  userId = auth.uid(), vocabularyLevel, grammarLevel, readingLevel, listeningLevel,\n  radarData = JSONB, sourceAssessmentResultId = result.id\n) [Data Owner: LearnerProfile domain]
activate DB
DB --> AssessSvc: SkillProfile updated
deactivate DB

AssessSvc -> AssessSvc: Apply English A1 Placement Mapping A:\n  0-7: Unit 1 | 8-12: Unit 2 | 13-17: Unit 3\n  18-22: Unit 4 | 23-26: Unit 5 | 27-30: Unit 6

AssessSvc -> DB: UPDATE "LearnerProfile" SET\n  verifiedProficiency = 'VERIFIED'\nWHERE userId = auth.uid()\n(Candidate starting_unit INT on Profile [TARGET-CANDIDATE DD-06 / OPEN DESIGN])
activate DB
DB --> AssessSvc: LearnerProfile updated
deactivate DB

AssessSvc --> Web: 200 OK {\n  resultId: result.id,\n  rawScores: { total: rawScore, vocab, grammar, reading, listening },\n  skillProfile: { vocabularyLevel, grammarLevel, readingLevel, listeningLevel },\n  startingUnit: resolvedUnitId,\n  verifiedProficiency: 'VERIFIED'\n}
deactivate AssessSvc

Web --> Learner: Display Placement Summary (SCR-L-05)\n- Radar Chart of 4 Skill Dimensions\n- Recommended Starting Unit\n- Zero CEFR certification claimed

== 4. Diagnostic Retake Flow (from Profile) ==
opt Learner Initiates Retake from Profile (SCR-L-14)
    Learner -> Web: Click "Retake Diagnostic Assessment"
    Web -> AssessSvc: POST /api/assessment/diagnostic/start { retake: true }
    activate AssessSvc
    note over AssessSvc, DB
        Invariant: Retake creates a BRAND NEW AssessmentResult record.
        Prior results remain preserved as immutable historical audit evidence.
    end note
    AssessSvc --> Web: 200 OK { sessionId: newSessionId }
    deactivate AssessSvc
    Web --> Learner: Launch new test runner
end
deactivate Web

@enduml
